{"title":"2011 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Keegan paddled the first 12 km of his 36 km kayak trip before lunch. What fraction\nof his overall trip remains to be completed after lunch?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/5/ea551640db6f822121978fd7af152e97e4995389.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ \\frac{1}{2} \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ \\frac{5}{6} \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ \\frac{3}{4} \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ \\frac{2}{3} \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ \\frac{3}{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"408\" height=\"38\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Subtract_First.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Subtract_First)\">Solution 1 (Subtract First)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Subtract First)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Keegan has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/6/2664d7fb74703d9681a2f60489c8a1c8dc358724.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$36 - 12 = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"15\" /> km to go, so the fraction of his overall trip that remains to be completed after lunch is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/2/912d9628b30a08a95f980b10a90a56ce56f5905d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{24}{36} = \\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } \\frac{2}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"108\" height=\"49\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Fraction_First.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Fraction_First)\">Solution 2 (Fraction First)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Fraction First)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Keegan did <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/8/e78a4802c70400e4eb172cb75f9db2b411b33608.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{12}{36} = \\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"58\" height=\"37\" /> of his trip, so the fraction of his overall trip that remains to be completed after lunch is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/7/707f4d91752d7634317e3e5eb571510dfe03cbb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 - \\frac{1}{3} = \\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } \\frac{2}{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -19px\" width=\"131\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)\" title=\"2011 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)\">2011 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_7)_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 CEMC Gauss (Grade 7) Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" row